  "label": "User projected onto the scene of impending disappointment",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the overall scene created by the man's smug expression and the overlaid text 'brace yourself' and 'disappointment is coming'. The meme format directly addresses the viewer by implying that the viewer must brace for disappointment, which is embodied in the visual of the man's confident demeanor. The projection is onto the scene (smug_expression_with_text) which combines both visual and textual elements to create a direct address to the user.",
